# The top-level `Application` layer is reserved for cross-context use cases.
#
# Nothing lives here yet by design: cross-context transactions (for example a use case that
# registers a user and then opens a session) have not emerged. Add use cases under
# `src/Application/{Part}/` as they do.
#
# This directory is referenced by `DomainSpecification`, which forbids the shared
# kernel in `src/Domain` from depending on it. It is a guarded empty namespace, not a
# forgotten one.